            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.17.14+2CH.17.15+2CH.17.16+2CH.17.17+2CH.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 17:14-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.26.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Amaziya akoranya Abayuda, abakurikiranya ukw amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, ngo bagabge n’abagaba ibihumbi n’abagaba amajana; abakoranya ar’ Abayuda bose n’Ababenyamini; arabaharūra uhereye ku bamaze imyaka mirongwibiri no kuja hejuru, asanga ar’ ingabo ibihumbi amajana atatu, abantu b’intōre bashobora gutabara mu ntambara, bazi uburyo bgo gutwara amacumu n’ inkinzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arārika n’ingabo ibihumbi ijana mu Bisirayeli, abantu b’abahizi, abagerera italanto z’ ifeza ijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma haza umuntu w’Imana kuri we, aramubarira, ati Mwami, izo ngabo z’Abisirayeli ntuzijane, kuk’ Uhoraho atari kumwe n’Abisirayeli, ari bo bano bantu bose b’Abefurayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko namba wiyumvira yuko mur’ ubgo buryo ari ho uzoronka intsinzi mu ntambara, Imana izotuma uneshwa n’abansi; ifise ububasha bgo kugutabara n’ubgo gutuma uneshwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya yishura uwo muntu w’Imana, at’ Arikw italanto ijana nahaye ingabo z’Abisirayeli, zo twozigira dute? Uwo muntu w’Imana aramwishura, at’ Uhoraho ashobora kuguha ibisumba ivyo kure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Amaziya asobanura izo ngabo zaje kuri we zivuye i Bgefurayimu, ngo zisubire i wabo; ivyo bibatera kurakira Abayuda uburake bginshi, basubira i wabo bajanye umwikomo mwinshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
