            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.17+2KI.14.18+2KI.14.19+2KI.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 14:17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowasi mwene Yehowahazi umwami w’Abisirayeli amaze gutanga, Amaziya mwene Yowasi umwami w’i Buyuda amara iyindi myaka cumi n’itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Amaziya, uhereye ku ca mbere ugashitsa ku c’imperēra, none ntivyanditswe mu gitabo c’abami b’i Buyuda n’i Bgisirayeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva igihe Amaziya arekeye gukurikira Uhoraho baciye bamuvyukiriza umugararizo i Yerusalemu, araheza ahungira i Lakishi; barungika abamukurikirana i Lakishi, bamutsindayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuvyimba wiwe bawuremēka amafarasi, barawuzana bamuhamba hamwe na ba sekuruza ku murwa w’i Buyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
